{"articleNo":"843","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=843&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Xilinx FPGA 설계 인증과정 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.06.10","hit":"13961","attachments":[{"name":"2009_모집안내문 및 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=843&attachNo=70002"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"578\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"572\">\n            <p style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0021b0\">*수정안내 : </font><font color=\"#ec0078\">참가신청서가 변경</font><font color=\"#fd1289\">되었으니</font><font color=\"#0021b0\"> 확인하고 제출바랍니다. (2009.6.11)</font></u></strong></span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none\" align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none\" align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">Xilinx FPGA 설계 인증과정 교육생 모집</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">(2009년도 하계)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> <br>&nbsp; <br>&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 목&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 : 디지털 하드웨어 설계 분야의 실무 중심 교육을 통해 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">Xilinx 공인</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">인증서 및 교육과정 수료증을 발급</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">함으로써 취업 역량을 강화하기 위함</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">2. 예산지원 : 교육역량강화사업(교육과학기술부 지원)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">3. 주관학부 : 전자공학부</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">4. 교육장소 : 금오공대 디지털관 435호</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">5. 교육기간 : </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; •&nbsp; 1기 교육과정 : 2009년 7월 6일(월) ~ 7월 10일(금)&nbsp;(5일, 30시간)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; 2기 교육과정 : 2009년 8월 3일(월) ~ 8월 7일(금) (5일, 30시간)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">6. 교육내용 : HDL(Verilog 또는 VHDL)와 FPGA를 이용한 디지털회로 설계 및 검증</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 1기 교육과정 : Verilog HDL을 이용한 FPGA 설계</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 2기 교육과정 : VHDL을 이용한 FPGA 설계</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">7. 지원자격 : 전자공학부 소속 3학년 또는 4학년 학부생 또는 대학원생</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① “ASIC 설계 및 실습”, “VHDL 설계 및 실습” 교과목 이수자, 또는</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② “Verilog-HDL과 FPGA를 이용한 디지털시스템 설계” (09.6.29~7.2, 디지</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 털산업지원교육센터, http://gdec.kumoh.ac.kr) 과정 이수 예정자, 또는</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ Verilog HDL 또는 VHDL에 관한 사전 지식이 있는 자</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">8. 모집인원 : 교육 기수별 15~20명</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">9. 참가 신청서 : 전자공학부 홈페이지 또는&nbsp;차세대반도체 홈페이지</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</font><a href=\"http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec\"><font face=\"굴림\">http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec</font></a><font face=\"굴림\">)에서 다운로드<br></font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">10. </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">신청기 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"&gt;<font face=\"굴림\">2009년 6월 10일(수) ~ 6월 23일(화) 오후 5시</font></font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></font></p><font face=\"굴림\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제출처 : 디지털관 학사행정실(김인설) 또는 신경욱교수 연구실</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (D429호)에 제출</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">11. </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">교육 대상자 발표 :</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 2009년 6월 24일(수)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">※</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">전자공학부 홈페이지, 차세대반도체 홈페이지</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ( </font><a href=\"http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec\"><font face=\"굴림\">http://kit.kumoh.ac.kr/~icdec</font></a><font face=\"굴림\">)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">12. </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">교육생 특전</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 인증시험 통과자에게 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">Xilinx Training Center의 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">공인 인증서</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\"> 수여</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 교육과정 수료자에게 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font face=\"굴림\">수료증 수여</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 교육비 무료, 교재 제공 </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">13. 문의 : 신경욱 교수 (054-478-7427, </font><a href=\"mailto:kwshin@kumoh.ac.kr\"><font face=\"굴림\">kwshin@kumoh.ac.kr</font></a><font face=\"굴림\">)</font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n            </font></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
